      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Stress effect on cytochrome P-450 content in rat liver has been studied. There is evidence to the effect that stress factors of different origin cause the decline in cytochrome P-450 content both in the control group and in the conditions of induction. The data obtained enable us to suppose that stress causes intensification of cytochrome P-540 degradation process, the induction efficiency being steady."},
